# PR review

Use skill `.cursor/skills/pr-review/SKILL.md` for low-token reviews.

## Blockers

| Area | Check |
|------|-------|
| Anti-leak | No internal brands, proprietary paths, secrets |
| Arch freeze | No silent redesign of planes/services/topics |
| Config | No hardcoded env in feature code |
| Contracts | OpenAPI / `vp.*` updated when API/events change |
| Tests | Behavior change has test or recorded smoke |
| Evidence | Card evidence present if PR closes a card |
| Scope | Diff matches card allowed paths |

## Architecture freeze

Features may land behind flags. Changing Compose plane boundaries, topic prefixes, or Nest ownership of state needs an **ADR** first.

## Output

`path:line: severity: problem. Fix.`  
Severities: blocker / major / minor. Default: blockers + majors only.
